%I A402145 #5 Nov 23 2026 09:30:00
%S A402145 1,1,1,2,3,5,8,13,22,38,67,120,217,395,722,1324,2434,4485,8283,15333
%N A402145 Number of integer compositions of n that have 1-based restricted growth and whose reverse also has 1-based restricted growth.
%C A402145 A 1-based restricted growth sequence of length j is a sequence (a_1, ..., a_j), satisfying a_1 = 1 and a_i <= 1 + max(a_1, ..., a_{i-1}) for all i = 2, 3, ..., j.
%e A402145 The a(n) compositions for n = 1..8:
%e A402145   (1)  (11)  (111)  (121)   (1121)   (1221)    (11221)    (12221)
%e A402145                     (1111)  (1211)   (11121)   (12121)    (111221)
%e A402145                             (11111)  (11211)   (12211)    (112121)
%e A402145                                      (12111)   (111121)   (112211)
%e A402145                                      (111111)  (111211)   (121121)
%e A402145                                                (112111)   (121211)
%e A402145                                                (121111)   (122111)
%e A402145                                                (1111111)  (1111121)
%e A402145                                                           (1111211)
%e A402145                                                           (1112111)
%e A402145                                                           (1121111)
%e A402145                                                           (1211111)
%e A402145                                                           (11111111)
%t A402145 comps[n_]:=Join@@Permutations/@IntegerPartitions[n];
%t A402145 rgoQ[y_]:=y[[1]]==1&&And@@Table[y[[i]]<=1+Max@@Take[y,i-1],{i,2,Length[y]}];
%t A402145 Table[Length[Select[comps[n],rgoQ[#]&&rgoQ[Reverse[#]]&]],{n,10}]
%Y A402145 The version for patterns or normal sequences appears to be A007476.
%Y A402145 A subset of the normal compositions A107429, ranks A333217.
%Y A402145 For just the first (or just the second) condition we have A383253.
%Y A402145 These compositions are ranked by A402139 /\ A402148.
%Y A402145 A011782 counts compositions (row sums of A097805), strict A032020.
%Y A402145 A383713 counts compositions with restricted growth by length.
%Y A402145 A402138 counts compositions without 1-based restricted growth, ranks A402141.
%Y A402145 A402140 counts normal compositions without restricted growth, ranks A402143.
%Y A402145 A402142 counts compositions without restricted growth by length.
